<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON with the engine stopped.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, perform [Active Test] - [FP Relay ON].</ptxt>
